{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ed222609b88835995b29a431bdb55f583bc8ec3b674da376a5512ce1ddd19e0e", "ja": "お疲れさま、百合子。\nどうしたんだ？　ぼーっとして……。", "zh": "辛苦你了，百合子。\n怎么啦？看你愣在那里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "8bd95fcc4a9a51b7ca5899b8f394b44f63cf4c0429b091291759ca16a8ee357e", "ja": "私……まだ、なんだか信じられなくて……。\nあんな素敵なステージに、立ってたなんて……。", "zh": "我……到现在还不敢相信……\n自己居然能够站上这么棒的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "36adadae2febfc437aca5f9db361dd633c4df42ca839f4a2eb15482d89d6a899", "ja": "ひょっとして私……本で読んだことを、現実だって\n勘違いしちゃってるんじゃないでしょうか！？", "zh": "该不会……\n我把在书里看到的事跟现实搞混了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1004_p", "source_sha256": "207e6d24815f6fc58560cd5573236aeef13ab607e8133c35ae569b17bc49921e", "ja": "百合子、それは……。", "zh": "百合子，那只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "691d498bddc380abe2fb240ff05a4a6b64eab5b6ec6127721301906e74880354", "ja": "いいえ！　いいんです、{$P$}さん。\nたとえこれが、儚い夢や幻だったとしても、私……！", "zh": "不！没关系的，{$P$}先生。\n就算这是一场飘渺的梦境或幻觉，我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "81108d699b5b4aec896cac2bd24321c9be9e9ad433fe635e67c4969b3b3c4548", "ja": "それでもいいって思うくらい、素敵な景色でした！\n華やかなステージ、満員のお客様、大きな歓声……。", "zh": "我仍然觉得无所谓，毕竟这景色如此美妙！\n华丽的舞台、满场的观众、大大的欢呼声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "e771095d3537e88aa28a374c6fd7891352eee466dc18912d4087b3ecb8f68cbd", "ja": "あんな素敵なものが見られたんです。本当の私が、\nダンスを間違えてばかりでも、生きていけます……！", "zh": "既然看到了那么美妙的事物，\n就算现实中的我总是跳错舞步，我也能活下去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e9cfd9a6c0ebbbdece49981bb43578d334b07adff2c7ae3be33473cd404af255", "ja": "うん、一回落ち着こう。それに、今日、\n百合子がステージに立っていたのは、現実だからな。", "zh": "嗯，你先冷静一下。\n而且，今天百合子站上舞台这件事，可是事实喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "bf051266fdf23302735518c9cdd7253d969aa5135c2e60db7a9deb2147713ae4", "ja": "えっ……ほ、本当なんですか！？\n私の妄想じゃなかったんですか？", "zh": "咦……真、真的吗！？\n不是我的妄想吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1010_p", "source_sha256": "092cac615bc741ea7b8b49dd7abcf5f71f40c19fa0d497305f06a30511cc19a7", "ja": "本当だよ。今日のステージは、ちゃんと、\n百合子が現実の努力で作ったんだ。", "zh": "是真的。今天的表演，\n确实是百合子在现实中努力造就的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9db79279d8328ae63b9897df5bb769e882e2c1f022516fcafa8d1982bb3a5c71", "ja": "だから百合子も、ちゃんと頑張った自分のこと、\n少しくらいほめてあげないと。", "zh": "所以百合子也得夸奖一下\n好好努力过的自己才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1012_p", "source_sha256": "33f66bbbc2c1b681228aebb73c61474c98f137f73a4cc69deda730c34a1a5c99", "ja": "そして、もっと自信を持っていこう。\n百合子には、人一倍、強い想いがあるじゃないか。", "zh": "然后，对自己再多抱持点自信吧。\n百合子的意念不是比其他人要强上一倍吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "caef80327d1c65421ccd865184ae30dc5c6e7c92942377300f6bbfdcfef4841d", "ja": "あ……ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "谢……谢谢你，\n{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "f4b676d1fe3050410e849c0668c016ea7ed69bc9f6a02f6dd098e4c17bf94c49", "ja": "何もなかった私を、ここまで導いてくれて。", "zh": "谢谢你引领什么都不会的我一路走到这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0034_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "c96837c826ee68325243b2232f3dabfad319406c215f828d744c936cccc22e40", "ja": "私、歌もダンスももっともっと練習して……この感動を\nみなさんに伝えられるよう、これからも頑張りますね！", "zh": "今后我会更加努力练习歌唱跟跳舞……\n为了把这份感动带给大家，我会继续加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
